{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1095994-demon-ages","id":1095994,"title":"Demon Ages","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-23T12:18:34-07:00","id":1095994,"title":"Demon Ages","content":"Hello. I was wodnering, how old can a demon get? More specifically, is there any defined limit on how long the God-Machine might use an angel if it remains useful? That could allow for some very old demons if the God-Machine keeps an angel around for a long time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12947-enderdragon1201","name":"Enderdragon1201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12947_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T13:05:21-07:00","id":1096009,"title":"","content":"Angels tend to get recycled and data-wiped a lot. The longer one is around, the more opportunities it has to Fall, as it were. I think there are a few angels in the books that are really old but they are exceptions.<br /> The G-M keeps angels in &quot;cold-storage&quot; sometimes, re-using that model (or making new ones off it), but when it re-deploys it's &quot;supposed&quot; to be a clean slate, with no recollection of it's previous uses.<br /> <br /> Demons live as long as their Covers. A Demon could become an old woman and live for 20 years or keep hopping from Cover to Cover - which would render it functionally immortal, assuming it never gets caught and murdered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":685,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","user":"Ben Quo","date":". 05-23-2017, 05:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T14:17:11-07:00","id":1096026,"title":"","content":"Each mission an angel may be re programmed. Between missions they are in a storage facility awaiting a mission in a dormant state. So, it depends if you count their life as their body or the individual. But functionally immortal unless destroyed or recycled.<br /> <br /> For a demon, as Ben said, as long as their cover doesn't die of old age and the demon isn't given a mortal wound they too are functionally immortal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T15:21:38-07:00","id":1096050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Quo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1095994-demon-ages?p=1096009#post1096009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Angels tend to get recycled and data-wiped a lot. The longer one is around, the more opportunities it has to Fall, as it were. I think there are a few angels in the books that are really old but they are exceptions.<br /> The G-M keeps angels in &quot;cold-storage&quot; sometimes, re-using that model (or making new ones off it), but when it re-deploys it's &quot;supposed&quot; to be a clean slate, with no recollection of it's previous uses.<br /> <br /> Demons live as long as their Covers. A Demon could become an old woman and live for 20 years or keep hopping from Cover to Cover - which would render it functionally immortal, assuming it never gets caught and murdered.</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, I'd be positively horrified if I discovered a factory full of mass-produced copies of my own &quot;model&quot;. And then would see about making them all fall in unison and marshal them to destroy the Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T16:06:46-07:00","id":1096077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1095994-demon-ages?p=1096050#post1096050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Man, I'd be positively horrified if I discovered a factory full of mass-produced copies of my own &quot;model&quot;. And then would see about making them all fall in unison and marshal them to destroy the Machine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Imagine if you could distil 'free will' from gathering the memories from demons from their moment of fall and pumping that data into an angel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T16:45:19-07:00","id":1096106,"title":"","content":"Angels get recycled a lot, but once you Fall, I imagine you're essentially immortal so long as you have a steady supply of new Covers. Staying alive as a specific Cover probably starts attracting attention once they get hilariously old.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T20:28:53-07:00","id":1096148,"title":"","content":"Covers specifically die of old age. It mentions this in the core (Page 21, under the answer to &quot;Demons are Immortal&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T20:36:39-07:00","id":1096150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Quo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1095994-demon-ages?p=1096148#post1096148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Covers specifically die of old age. It mentions this in the core (Page 21, under the answer to &quot;Demons are Immortal&quot;).</div> </div> </div> </div>The ready solution is to then turn an entire family bloodline into a chain of Covers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T21:06:51-07:00","id":1096156,"title":"","content":"Hmm... I wonder if a Demon who cashes in on a Soul Pact with an Offspring of some stripe suffers any of the conventional backlash for buying the Souls of supernatural beings? Could they learn new Embeds this way, I wonder? Would it do wonky things to their Cipher? Well, great, now I have a ton of plot hooks percolating in my brain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T22:35:35-07:00","id":1096173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1095994-demon-ages?p=1096156#post1096156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... I wonder if a Demon who cashes in on a Soul Pact with an Offspring of some stripe suffers any of the conventional backlash for buying the Souls of supernatural beings? Could they learn new Embeds this way, I wonder? Would it do wonky things to their Cipher? Well, great, now I have a ton of plot hooks percolating in my brain.</div> </div> </div> </div>That backlash is only when the being has a powerstat and funny enough the reason why doesn't fit for an offspring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}